### Ask the support assistant
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/ask
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "When is your support desk open?"
}

### A request with the message missing
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/ask
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### A message of the wrong type
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/ask
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": 42
}
